		)
		(property "Footprint" "Package_TO_SOT_SMD:SOT-223-3_TabPin2"
			(at 0 5.08 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Datasheet" "https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/11925722caecb155eb3f8664b8021015.pdf?productCode=C150716"
			(at 2.54 -6.35 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "BCD Semiconductor (Diodes Incorporated) AP2114H-3.3TRG1, SOT-223 (H package), genuinely CMOS-process LDO ('1A LOW NOISE CMOS LDO REGULATOR WITH ENABLE', rev. Jan 2013) swapped in for U1's prior AMS1117-3.3 (bipolar NPN-pass, see power.kicad_sch's dropout-margin note, pilink-ddq). Real datasheet Electrical Characteristics table, AP2114-3.3 section: Dropout Voltage VDROP @ IOUT=1A = 450mV (typ) / 750mV (max); Maximum Output Current guaranteed >=1.0A (min) at VIN=4.3V, VOUT=3.25-3.35V; Recommended Supply Voltage 2.5-6.0V (Absolute Max 6.5V). Stable with a 4.7uF 'Flexible Cap: Ceramic, Tantalum and Aluminum Electrolytic' on both CIN and COUT per the datasheet's own test conditions and feature list -- no tantalum-specific requirement unlike AMS1117. Pin Descriptions table for the SOT-223 (H) package: pin1=GND, pin2=VOUT, pin3=VIN -- IDENTICAL pin-to-pad mapping as the AMS1117-3.3 this replaces (same SOT-223-3_TabPin2 footprint, tab=VOUT=pin2), chosen specifically to minimize layout/decoupling churn since PCB layout (pilink-7el.9) hadn't started yet when this swap was made. The 3-pin H/HA SOT-223 package has no EN pin (EN only exposed on the SOIC-8/PSOP-8/ADJ packages) -- always enabled, same as AMS1117's wiring, no extra components needed. LCSC C150716, confirmed via jlcpcb-search MCP 2026-11-15: 10,090 units in stock (Extended part)."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "ki_keywords" "linear regulator ldo fixed positive cmos low dropout"
			(at 0 0 0)
			(effects
